    "snippet": {
      "publishedAt": "2019-11-27T22:32:49.000Z",
      "channelId": "UCIP244iNzbn4iEkDOgczvcQ",
      "title": "Rebuilding a Faster, Lazier Slack | Samantha Siow | CascadiaJS 2019",
      "description": "Join us at CascadiaJS 2020 in Bend, OR 🌲  https://2020.cascadiajs.com\n---\n\nA new version of Slack is rolling out for our desktop customers, built from the ground up to be faster, more efficient, and easier to work on. In this talk, I’ll focus on our move from an eager data model to a lazily loaded and incomplete data model, and how that made for a speedier Slack experience.",
