      "channelId": "UCIP244iNzbn4iEkDOgczvcQ",
      "title": "Authentication for the REST of Us | Divya Sasidharan | CascadiaJS 2019",
      "description": "Join us at CascadiaJS 2020 in Bend, OR 🌲  https://2020.cascadiajs.com\n---\n\nAuthentication is a complicated subject that is hard to grok, let’s unpack all kinds of auth concepts and examine how we can apply them to our applications.",
