      "channelId": "UCIP244iNzbn4iEkDOgczvcQ",
      "title": "Making Reusable SVGs with React | Isabela Moreira | CascadiaJS 2019",
      "description": "Join us at CascadiaJS 2020 in Bend, OR 🌲  https://2020.cascadiajs.com\n---\n\nLearn how to merge your creative side with your coding side in this live-coding talk! Leveraging the practice of reusable code and React components, we’ll create SVG images and animations that can be extended, adapted, and reused throughout your app. See how a few tweaks and props injected into your standard SVG code can give you the power of composable and reusable components!",
