      "channelId": "UCIP244iNzbn4iEkDOgczvcQ",
      "title": "When Porgs Scream at Webpack and Other Stories | Dominik Kundel | CascadiaJS 2019",
      "description": "Join us at CascadiaJS 2020 in Bend, OR 🌲  https://2020.cascadiajs.com\n---\n\nFor many web developers the world of hardware is very intimidating. There is no easy way to go back from a broken to a working project state. You break something, you replace it — there is no Ctrl/Cmd + z. However, getting a project to work is incredibly fun and rewarding. In this talk we'll be talking about different ways you can use your JavaScript knowledge to build your own hardware projects.",
